// S~S  SimpleSal signal starts  S~S

// [Portability considerations.note]    search in ssTEA source files for a reference to this file.
//
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Multiple applications based on the same mesa may have the same mesa_*.h files with each sketch.
   A single application based on multiple mesas may need a distinct set per mesa, or may use common
   terminology and build-time switches to select what the term actually means on the mesa in use.
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   "portability" in an application may be based on mesa(s) supported by a common file, all sketches,
   in that case the INO sketch file itself becomes specific to the Mesa instance the App runs on.
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// S~S  SimpleSal signal ends  S~S
